/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #77 (hover) — primary CTA :hover Material elevation bump */
/* csfloat measured: .mat-mdc-raised-button.mat-primary base shadow is the
   Material level1 stack: rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 0 3px 1px -2px,
   rgba(0,0,0,0.14) 0 2px 2px 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 0 1px 5px 0. On :hover
   it lifts to level2: rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 0 2px 4px -1px,
   rgba(0,0,0,0.14) 0 4px 5px 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 0 1px 10px 0. The bg
   color stays rgb(35,123,255) — Material adds an 8% state-layer overlay
   on the ::before ripple, but visually only the shadow lift reads.
   Transition is box-shadow 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1). NO transform. */
/* sboxmarket .btn-primary :hover currently nudges color/background — replace
   with the elevation lift to match csfloat's restraint. */
