   csfloat measure: mat-card.item-card uses transition: 0.3s (all,
   ease). sboxmarket .card / .item-card mostly match but several
   custom card classes drift to 140-220ms. Pin every card-class
   container to csfloat's exact 300ms duration with Material easing. */
