/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #1419 — Modal panel surface parity
   Measured csfloat: .blurred-dialog-container .mat-mdc-dialog-container has
   border-radius: 12px, border: 2px solid var(--highlight-background),
   backdrop-filter: blur(16px); .mdc-dialog__surface inherits the same radius.
   Localhost .modal had border-radius var(--r-md) which resolves to 14px and a
   1px border — close but visibly off when stacked next to a csfloat tab.
   Lock to 12px radius and 2px border. */
