/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2900 — /buyorders standalone-card row spec
   Existing ship #75 painted .full-page-mode .buyorder-row as a flat
   stacked-list row (border-bottom hairline, no radius). csfloat treats
   the BUY ORDERS list on the dedicated /buy-orders surface the same
   way it treats trade rows in profile (see ship #1305): each row is
   a STANDALONE CARD — bg rgb(27,29,36), 1px rgb(38,40,48), 8px
   radius, 16px 20px padding, 12px stack gap. Override the older
   stacked-list spec on .full-page-mode + scope to .buyorder-list to
   keep the modal version (csfloat-modals.js) on the original
   stacked treatment ship #75 set. Aligns the standalone page with
   profile/offers/trades card chrome. */
body .full-page-mode .buyorder-list {
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  gap: 12px !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
}
