/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2903 — buyorder-row Cancel inline-button polish
   The ACTIVE-state Cancel button in csfloat-modals.js renders inline
   styles: 1px rgba(248,113,113,0.3) border, var(--red) text, 7px 14px
   pad, 12px font, .btn-ghost class. csfloat's analogous row action
