/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2904 — .trade-counterparty-* row block tokens
   Existing rules at line 7072 set .trade-counterparty-label /
   .trade-counterparty-missing / .trade-counterparty-copy /
   .trade-counterparty-link with token-prefix vars (--ink-2 etc.).
