/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #3304 — right-rail sticky behavior parity.
   Measure (csfloat /item .item-rail wrapper): position: sticky, top: 24px,
   align-self: flex-start so the rail sticks to the viewport top while the
   left column (gallery + price chart + recent sales) scrolls. Local rail
   scrolled with the page (no sticky). Add sticky pinning at the rail
   container level. The grid parent is .item-modal-grid / .item-page-grid
   with display:grid; the rail wrapper is the SECOND child of that grid.
   Use a generous selector net to catch the various wrappers used across
   the modal/page modes. Bottom-anchor variant for short rails: max-height
   fallback to viewport so the sticky doesn't poke past the page footer. */
body .modal.item-page .item-rail,
body .modal.item-page > .item-rail,
body .modal.item-page .modal-grid > :nth-child(2),
body .modal.item-page .item-modal-grid > :nth-child(2),
