/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6304 - /db drilldown empty state + foot + header. csfloat shows zero items feedback as a quiet centered note below the table at 12px ink-4 with a refresh hint. The local .db-foot is already there but lacks centering and the empty-row treatment when there are no rows. The header (Database 0 indexed) needs the csfloat 22px medium Roboto treatment. */
