/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6802 — Journey right column timeline + step
   layout (.timeline + .event parity). csfloat .timeline is flex column 720px
   wide; each .event is flex row gap 40px with a thin connector column +
   .box card. Re-skin local .csfloat-home-journey-steps + step. Kill the
   old single-line ::before; add per-step connector + dot pseudos. */
html body .csfloat-home-journey .csfloat-home-journey-steps {
