/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6500 — /SELL page header. csfloat ships a flush-left "Steam Inventory" page-title at 28px/500 with 0.3px tracking, sitting 24px above the inventory chrome row. Our existing .info-modal-header was 20px modal-style, wrong context and wrong density. Pull title to the left edge of the content well, bump weight, swap the label to "Steam Inventory", zero modal padding so it lines up with csfloat page-headers. */
