/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6501 — Refresh inventory + Sync status row above the inventory grid. csfloat puts a 40px tall outlined ghost button on the LEFT (1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12), 8px radius, 14px/500 label, blue #237bff text) plus a faint "Last synced: X min ago" caption (12px/400, 50% white). Render via ::before on .empty-inline so it persists in both empty and populated states. */
