/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6502 — Empty inventory state polish. csfloat empty card uses a 14px/500 white title, 13px/400 60%-white sub, centered with 64px top / 80px bottom padding, 12px gap. CTA pill: 44px tall, 24px horizontal padding, 8px radius, solid blue #237bff bg, white 15px/700 label. Tighten interior spacing of .empty-inline and re-skin .btn-accent to csfloat's exact button geometry. */
.empty-inline {
