}
/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6502 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6503 — Filter pills row (Tradable / All / Marketable). csfloat renders three text-only segments in a mat-button-toggle-group above the inventory grid: 40px tall container, 14px/500 segments, 16px horizontal padding per segment, 8px outer radius, transparent bg, 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.12) border, leftmost segment selected by default with rgba(35,123,255,0.15) tint + #237bff text. Synthesize via .empty-inline::after so it shows in empty + populated cases. */
.empty-inline::after {
