  letter-spacing: 0.3px !important;
  white-space: pre !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  word-spacing: 8px !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
}
/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6503 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #6504 — Item-count chip on the right of the inventory toolbar. csfloat shows a tiny "0 ITEMS" pill (24px tall, 11px/600 uppercase 0.6px-tracked label, rgba(193,206,255,0.06) bg, 6px radius, 0 12px padding, 50% white text, 1px subtle border). It anchors to the right edge of the inventory toolbar so users always see the count regardless of empty/populated. Render as an absolutely-positioned ::after on the page header so it sits in the toolbar row. */
