/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #7506 — Language picker panel border-radius parity.
   Measured live (csfloat .mat-mdc-select-panel for EN trigger): the panel
   anchors flush under the EN chip with border-radius 0 0 15px 15px so the
