   override; flatten to csfloat Roboto-stack 500 to read as
   the same surface heading they ship across receipt panels.
   Removes the bottom border so the heading rides flush with
   the first row, matching csfloat receipt cadence.
   ============================================================ */
.cart-summary-title {
