/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #14103 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #14104 (skeleton-avatar variant — circle placeholder)
   measured: csfloat's user avatar in headers + profile rail is a 40px round
   image (32px in compact rows, 64px on profile hero). For avatar/profile
   skeletons we ship a circle variant. Default 40px matches the chip avatar
   used in csfloat's right-cluster. Border-radius 50% guarantees a circle
   regardless of consumer width/height. */
html body .skeleton-avatar[class*="skeleton-"],
html body .skeleton-circle[class*="skeleton-"],
html body .skeleton-profile-pic[class*="skeleton-"],
html body .skeleton-thumb.skeleton-thumb-circle[class*="skeleton-"] {
