/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #15808 (breakpoint tick fallback — when csfloat is not driving inline widths because we control the bar locally, the standard CS:GO float thresholds 0.07 / 0.15 / 0.38 / 0.45 / 1.00 should map onto a fixed-range bar. csfloat per-item bars zoom into the skin's min/max float so they're scaled, but the local item-detail page often shows the canonical full-range bar — so we ship a fallback gradient on .csfloat-float-bar-track[data-fallback="full"] and .item-page-float-bar[data-range="canonical"] using the exact 5 segment colors at the canonical breakpoints. This stops segment widths collapsing to 0 when no inline style ships from the server. */
html body .csfloat-float-bar-track[data-fallback="full"],
html body .item-page-float-bar[data-range="canonical"],
html body .float-bar[data-range="full"] {
  background-image: linear-gradient(
    to right,
    rgb(0, 128, 0) 0%,
    rgb(0, 128, 0) 7%,
    rgb(24, 165, 24) 7%,
    rgb(24, 165, 24) 15%,
    rgb(154, 205, 50) 15%,
    rgb(154, 205, 50) 38%,
    rgb(205, 92, 92) 38%,
    rgb(205, 92, 92) 45%,
    rgb(249, 36, 36) 45%,
    rgb(249, 36, 36) 100%
  ) !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  height: 8px !important;
  border-radius: 4px !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  position: relative !important;
}
html body .float-bar[data-ticks="visible"]::before,
html body .csfloat-float-bar-track[data-ticks="visible"]::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right, transparent calc(7% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(7% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(7% + 0.5px), transparent calc(7% + 0.5px)),
    linear-gradient(to right, transparent calc(15% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(15% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(15% + 0.5px), transparent calc(15% + 0.5px)),
    linear-gradient(to right, transparent calc(38% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(38% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(38% + 0.5px), transparent calc(38% + 0.5px)),
    linear-gradient(to right, transparent calc(45% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(45% - 0.5px), rgba(0,0,0,0.35) calc(45% + 0.5px), transparent calc(45% + 0.5px));
  z-index: 0;
}
/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #15808 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #15809 (current-float marker — 3px wide / 14px tall pill positioned absolutely with top:-3px so it overhangs the 8px bar by 3px on top and 3px on bottom, centred horizontally on the float position via "left:calc(N% - 2px)" offset, light grey rgb(217,217,217) fill, 4px radius, no border, no shadow). Measured live on csfloat .wear-marker computed: width 3px height 14px top -3px left calc(...% - 2px) background rgb(217,217,217) border-radius 4px box-shadow none. sbox local .csfloat-float-bar-marker had a triangle ::after and a thicker 2px/16px bar that didn't match the pill shape. Wipe ::before/::after, keep just the rectangle. */
