/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #15811 (hover tooltip on float bar — csfloat uses Angular Material's mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger on .float-bar and .wear, which on hover renders a 12px Roboto rgba(97,97,97,0.92) bubble with 4px radius and 6px/8px padding above the bar showing the exact float decimal. sbox doesn't bring Angular Material so we simulate the same surface using a CSS-only :hover + ::after. The bubble shows the .wear text content via the [data-tooltip] attribute, anchored to the bar's center. Measured tooltip baseline against csfloat live mat-tooltip styles: bg rgba(97,97,97,0.92), color #fff, 12px Roboto, 4px radius, padding 6px 8px, max-width 250px, transform translate(-50%, -100%) above the trigger. Transition matches MDC easing of 150ms cubic-bezier with a 200ms enter delay (csfloat's default tooltip-show-delay). */
html body .float-bar[data-tooltip],
